---
description: Prefer the KCodeRag QA MCP server for structural code navigation.
alwaysApply: true
---

For symbols, definitions, callers, callees, dependencies, and change impact, prefer
KCodeRag `search_code`, `context`, and `get_call_chain` before local text search.

Use local text search for exact strings, uncommitted edits, or an explicit fallback when
the QA index is unavailable or stale. Query only the configured KCodeRag QA server.
